Third-party content

The files under `docs/` listed below are verbatim copies of IETF RFCs,
reproduced for reference only:

  - `docs/rfc4506.txt` — RFC 4506, XDR: External Data Representation
    Standard.
  - `docs/rfc5531.txt` — RFC 5531, RPC: Remote Procedure Call Protocol
    Specification Version 2.
  - `docs/rfc7530.txt` — RFC 7530, Network File System (NFS) Version 4
    Protocol.

